        "Notes": "In the first oration, Patrizi mentions Bernardino Partenio, Lucio Scarano, Muzio Sforza, Francesco degli Oratori, Cornelio Frangipani, and Gisueppe Zarlino. In the second oration, are mentioned Lucio Scarano, Luigi Badoer, and Muzio Sforza. The relationship between this publication and the second Accademia Veneziana is not entirely sure, although Scarano is clearly associated to this and not to the first Accademia Veneziana (Accademia della Fama).",
